  "notes": "Every unit test of franken-speaker's harness, control adapter and playout adapter is in exactly one case. A case passes only when each of its tests reports ok in a centrally run `cargo test -- --nocapture` log; the measurement cases also need their records to re-derive in the judge. A case with no observation in the log is blocked, never passed.",
